### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
X-Device-Id: dev-123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "a1@a.com",
  "password": "password123@",
  "name": "이수",
  "nickname": "soo",
  "profileImageUrl": "",
  "thumbnailImageUrl": "",
  "birthDate": "1999-09-30"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
X-Device-Id: dev-123
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "a1@a.com",
  "password": "password123@"
}


### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 707d8851-e7d1-4438-99fc-443cade700ba

{
  "reason": "test"
}

### 회원가입 전화번호 인증
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verification/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "identifier": "xxxx@naver.com"
}


### 회원가입 인증번호 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/verification/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "identifier": "xxx@naver.com",
  "code": "059939"
}
